OL,3,GNEWSAPeople whose homes were flooded
OL,4,Aafter quarry blast fear it will happen
OL,5,Aagain
OL,6,
OL,7,FResidents who were evacuated from their
OL,8,Fhomes after a quarry blast forced a
OL,9,Ftorrent of dirty, brown water to wash
OL,10,Fdown a mountainside and flood their
OL,11,Fhomes are anxious it will happen again.
OL,13,FThirteen homes on Heol Berry in
OL,14,FGwaelod-y-Garth, Cardiff, were hit when
OL,15,Fwater from an old iron mine workings
OL,16,Fwas displaced by the planned blast.
OL,18,FKevin Duncan, who is part of campaign
OL,19,Fgroup Stronger Together Lesser Garth,
OL,20,Fsaid it had taken an "emotional toll"
OL,21,Fon residents, leaving them "really
OL,22,Fanxious".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
